<title>UK: Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets 500 million mark bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Ausgleichsbank sets 500 million mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE AUSGLEICHSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    08.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.67    PAY DATE    08.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.495    SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    DDF/FFT   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  2.175     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 10-YEAR BUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
